{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udea7 <strong>This game is still in development!</strong> \ud83d\udea7</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are actively working on updates, new content, and improvements based on player feedback. Expect regular patches and new features!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ongoing development with community feedback</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the enchanting world of <strong>Tactical Battle</strong>, a turn-based RPG that combines strategy and fantasy in an epic quest for victory. Choose from an eclectic roster of characters, including noble knights, powerful wizards, fearsome dragons, and unique classes like Father Nature, each with their own distinct abilities and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in thrilling tactical battles where positioning and skill selection are key to outsmarting your opponents. Draw from a vast array of skills and perk abilities to customize your characters and create powerful synergies that can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you journey through beautifully crafted landscapes, face off against a variety of foes, culminating in a climactic battle against the menacing Devil boss. Will you rise to the challenge and lead your team to victory, or will darkness prevail? Prepare for an adventure filled with strategy, creativity, and unforgettable moments in <strong>Tactical Battle</strong>!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Wizard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3310350/9851cf4384f7132e4458a583e60040a3154178d0.jpg"},{"name":"The Robot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3310350/743b1273515396139f9b9673e907121ab1632c4b.jpg"},{"name":"Father Nature","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3310350/157c6340e5cb7c017294eeb29d99cc13902bf1f0.jpg"},{"name":"The Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3310350/550e8b4a6c89cdda4aede3c029ebe0a894c3032e.jpg"},{"name":"The Devil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3310350/03c187ac93875d74fcbd020190450062002574ce.jpg"},{"name":"Lvl 30","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3310350/30f6020016807c48ccb3e4779323b1534242635c.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3310350?t=1739916828","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3310350?t=1739916828","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310350/3323b9c13563d2d49695b776c1e06bbe1aa71647/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739916828","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310350/3323b9c13563d2d49695b776c1e06bbe1aa71647/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739916828","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udea7 <strong>This game is still in development!</strong> \ud83d\udea7</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are actively working on updates, new content, and improvements based on player feedback. Expect regular patches and new features!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ongoing development with community feedback</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the enchanting world of <strong>Tactical Battle</strong>, a turn-based RPG that combines strategy and fantasy in an epic quest for victory. Choose from an eclectic roster of characters, including noble knights, powerful wizards, fearsome dragons, and unique classes like Father Nature, each with their own distinct abilities and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in thrilling tactical battles where positioning and skill selection are key to outsmarting your opponents. Draw from a vast array of skills and perk abilities to customize your characters and create powerful synergies that can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you journey through beautifully crafted landscapes, face off against a variety of foes, culminating in a climactic battle against the menacing Devil boss. Will you rise to the challenge and lead your team to victory, or will darkness prevail? Prepare for an adventure filled with strategy, creativity, and unforgettable moments in <strong>Tactical Battle</strong>!</p>","developers":["Franck Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310350/header.jpg?t=1739916828","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257067505,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257067505/movie480.mp4?t=1730409848","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257067505/movie_max.mp4?t=1730409848"},"name":"Tactical Battles","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257067505/215f3836bd4ac70ea6b9f3289f68f07e3386b948/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1730409848","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257067505/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1730409848","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257067505/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1730409848"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257071490,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257071490/movie480.mp4?t=1730947958","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstati